  "description": "Hildegard is the best seamstress in Luminian, but her past life was different. Born in Korea, she was raised to work in fashion before she died in an accident. Now reborn in a fantasy world, she turns to sewing again, unaware that her talent has caught the eye of the crown prince. With an ambition to advance his empire through textile arts, he makes her a surprising offer to become the empress. As fate unwinds like thread from a spool, this choice will reshape her life—and the empire—for good.\n\n(Source:Tapas)",
